      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "This should probably be renamed \"Explore using current version of the Library of Congress bagit-java library\", because we switched to our own implementation (see ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/blob/master/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/importexport/common/BagWriter.java)."
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/blob/master/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/importexport/common/BagWriter.java).",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": "  We did this to resolve issues we were having with the LoC bagit-java.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I do still see bagit-java in pom.xml (",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/blob/master/pom.xml#L74-L78),"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/blob/master/pom.xml#L74-L78),",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " so that should be removed if we don't switch back.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
