     "body": "<p>This should probably be renamed \"Explore using current version of the Library of Congress bagit-java library\", because we switched to our own implementation (see <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/blob/master/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/importexport/common/BagWriter.java).\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/blob/master/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/importexport/common/BagWriter.java).</a>  We did this to resolve issues we were having with the LoC bagit-java.</p>\n\n<p>I do still see bagit-java in pom.xml (<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/blob/master/pom.xml#L74-L78\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/blob/master/pom.xml#L74-L78</a>), so that should be removed if we don't switch back.</p>",
